; Behaviour block: Satan, and the sprite block of the smoke (kind 17, room 24)
;
; Used by Satan (attribute $42, #R$BB57), a two-part sprite: the upper half 4 bytes wide and the lower half. After the 5
; header bytes (hit box 30 x 46 pixels): attribute, width in bytes (4), height in 2-pixel units (12), four sprite
; addresses of the body. Then the sprite block of the cloud of smoke that replaces Satan (#R$95F6, used by the template
; #R$BD6A): attribute and four sprite addresses.
@label=BehaviourSatan
b$95E6 DEFB $00,$00,$17,$0F,$02  ; hit box top, left, bottom, right (2-pixel units); slot +$15 (Unknown)
 $95EB DEFB $42,$04,$0C  ; attribute, width (bytes), height (2-pixel units)
 $95EE DEFW $D78F    ; body sprite
 $95F0 DEFW $D796    ; body sprite
 $95F2 DEFW $D793    ; body sprite
 $95F4 DEFW $D79A    ; body sprite
@label=SpriteBlockSmoke
 $95F6 DEFB $47      ; smoke: attribute
 $95F7 DEFW $D79D    ; sprite
 $95F9 DEFW $D7A5    ; sprite
 $95FB DEFW $D7A1    ; sprite
 $95FD DEFW $D7A9    ; sprite
